    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is a linear visual novel. It has a few choices, but they do not have an impact on the ending, instead they provide different content to the reader. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a continuation of Chapter 4 and is the conclusion of Book 1. It is highly recommended to play through the other chapters first, before starting this one. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Folken as he starts his first adventure in a world that is reigned by magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the complex world of this fantasy story and discover creatures, lore, abilities and a lot of characters with unique personalities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 45 CG's to unlock. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single playthrough takes about 5-8 hours. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Folken and his friends have made it to the Rebels and earned their trust. It appears that their paths are set, yet fate seems to have other plans for them... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits to the artists and music composers:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >myphuocanime </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >soanala </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >boilingduck100 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Son Huynh </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuyunokawa </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kuwandiaru </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emfrizky </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deny </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Okela Studio </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >beng312 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheita </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bchynta </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sotomie </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ThePunt </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FeliciaNamikaze </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rochalerka </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Erwin_mangetsu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keYA </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tusktas </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polcastr </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shiredora </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Niczierou </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sora_nimo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ags_arts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arisu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RenzyBoii </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fauron714 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >abiboge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lazymk </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >luiilafete </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hilmeen </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venoir </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatsu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiwa_dak </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RamliKew </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AoriSora </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >zeroyama </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hervitepes </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rean_kidd </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >refu </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sora_nimo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allvana </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pillaridha </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arion910 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ARnd </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Komaru_i </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kureonachi </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >yog09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Azxrex </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uikoui </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kyuriuz </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sofiacanoart </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romaniacc </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >siftfolio </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >kanasricharoenc </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >firstiawan11 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >widya_gfx </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polcastr </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lequang1210 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yusa </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >luiilafete </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polcastr </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--- </p><p